# Documentation build
# `*.md` stays ignored by default so ad-hoc notes are not committed; the
# allow-list below keeps the actual docs (README/CONTRIBUTING/AGENTS/docs/)
# and this repo's planning documents trackable.
/book/
*.md
!README.md
!README.zh-CN.md
!AGENTS.md
!CONTRIBUTING.md
!CONTRIBUTING.zh-CN.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!.github/**/*.md
!docs/**/*.md
